  m_text: You will need to monitor the instrument panel of your aircraft and prevent
    critical errors in the system, for this, if there is a threat of loss of speed,
    you will need to pay attention to the instrument panel, it has three indicators
    displaying 3 of your engines, if one of the engines fails you will lose speed
    , by losing speed you increase the flight time to your final destination, when
    the flight time becomes more than the required time, then you lose, but if you
    pay attention to the panel quickly and without stopping, you will cope with the
    task and move on, with each different path It becomes more and more difficult,
    but everything is in your hands, Good luck!
